{"symbol":"GLO.PA","area":"europe","updated":"2026-11-16T19:18:54Z","info":{"address1":"59 Quai Rambaud","city":"Lyon","zip":"69002","country":"France","phone":"33 4 78 17 61 76","fax":"33 4 78 17 61 77","website":"https://www.gl-events.com","industry":"Specialty Business Services","industryKey":"specialty-business-services","industryDisp":"Specialty Business Services","sector":"Industrials","sectorKey":"industrials","sectorDisp":"Industrials","longBusinessSummary":"GL Events SA provides integrated solutions and services for events in France and internationally. It operates through three divisions: GL Events Live, GL Events Exhibitions, and GL Events Venues. The GL Events Live division provides various business line specializations and services, including turnkey solutions from consulting and design to staging the event for corporate, institutional, and sports events. The GL Events Exhibitions division manages and coordinates a portfolio of trade shows and consumer fairs in various sectors, such as food, culture, textile, etc. The GL Events Venues division manages a network of venues that include convention centers, exhibition centers, concert halls, and multi-purpose facilities. The company was formerly known as Générale Location and changed its name to GL Events SA in 2003. The company was founded in 1978 and is headquartered in Lyon, France. GL Events SA is a subsidiary of Polygone SA.","companyOfficers":[{"maxAge":1,"name":"Mr. Olivier  Ginon","age":67,"title":"Chairman & CEO","yearBorn":1958,"fiscalYear":2024,"totalPay":577176,"exercisedValue":0,"unexercisedValue":0},{"maxAge":1,"name":"Mr. Olivier  Ferraton","title":"COO, Deputy CEO & President Live Division","fiscalYear":2024,"totalPay":889897,"exercisedValue":0,"unexercisedValue":0},{"maxAge":1,"name":"Ms. Anne-Sophie  Ginon","age":42,"title":"Managing Director","yearBorn":1983,"fiscalYear":2024,"totalPay":28750,"exercisedValue":0,"unexercisedValue":0},{"maxAge":1,"name":"Mr. Denis  Tomasicchio","title":"Gro